e},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":"Add compatibility with only websocket-capable clients (#2132)","commit_message":"* handle control protocol through websocket\r\n\r\nThe necessary behaviour is already in place,\r\nbut the wasm build only issued GETs, and the handler was not invoked.\r\n\r\n* get DERP-over-websocket working for wasm clients\r\n\r\n* Prepare for testing builtin websocket-over-DERP\r\n\r\nStill needs some way to assert that clients are connected through websockets,\r\nrather than the TCP hijacking version of DERP.\r\n\r\n* integration tests: properly differentiate between DERP transports\r\n\r\n* do not touch unrelated code\r\n\r\n* linter fixes\r\n\r\n* integration testing: unexport common implementation of derp server scenario\r\n\r\n* fixup! integration testing: unexport common implementation of derp server scenario\r\n\r\n* dockertestutil/logs: remove unhelpful comment\r\n\r\n* update changelog\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Csaba Sarkadi <sarkadicsa@tutanota.de>"},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"merged":true,"mergeable":null,"rebaseable":null,"mergeable_state":"unknown","merged_by":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/receiv